  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うーん、はづきさんのアドバイスで\r\nスカウトにきてみたけど……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱりそう簡単には見つからないよなぁ……ん？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（着物なんて、若いのに珍しい子がいるな……\r\nしゃがみこんでどうしたんだろう）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……君、大丈夫か？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010010,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……凛世、でしょうか……？\r\n下駄の鼻緒が……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "012",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010010",
    "charCategory": "stand_fix"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、切れちゃったのか……\r\nええと、ちょっとそれ、貸してくれないか",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010020,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーんと、何かで読んだんだ。たしかハンカチを裂いて……\r\n5円玉に通してっと。よっ……できた！",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はい。……ちょっと不格好だけど\r\n少し歩くくらいなら問題ないと思う",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010030,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……ご親切、感謝いたします\r\nですが……貴方さまのハンカチが……",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010040,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "お返しに、あがりますので……\r\nご所在を、お教えください",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……改めて見るとすごく美人な子だな……\r\nなんというか雰囲気がある……）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010050,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "あの……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　ああ！　すまんすまん\r\nハンカチは返さなくていいよ。貰ってくれ。それより……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルをやってみないか？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010060,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "アイ、ドル……？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そう、きみをプロデュースしたいんだ\r\n俺が必ず最高の舞台に連れていってみせる",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうかな？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010070,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "それはもしや……この凛世、\r\n殿方に、そのようなことを言われたのは、はじめてです……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ……す、すまん\r\n急にこんなこと言われても困るよな……",
    "charLipAnim": "blank",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、ちょっとでも興味があったら\r\nこの名刺の事務所にきてほしい。待ってるから",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010080,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……こちらに、貴方さまが……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010090,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……必ずや、お伺いいたします\r\nこの凛世、不義理は、いたしません。それでは……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010090"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "bg": "00001",
    "bgm": "001",
    "waitType": "effect"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（うーん、やっぱり連絡はないか……あの着物の子\r\nちょっと強引すぎたかな……）",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010100,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "御免下さい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "012",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あれ、君は……",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010110,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "先日は、ありがとう、ございました\r\nハンカチの、お返しに、参りました",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "これを……そうか、わざわざ持ってきてくれたのか\r\nなんだか悪いな",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010120,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "いえ……\r\nそれと、本日は……お返事をしに伺いました",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010130,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "凛世は、心を、決めました",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010140,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "これからは一生、貴方さまに、\r\nついて参ります",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ということは、決心してくれたのか！　\r\nありがとう！　……その、りんぜ……さん？",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1012001010150,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい、杜野凛世と、申します。ふつつかものですが\r\nどうぞ、よろしくお願いいたします",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101200002/1012001010150"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]